## 0.3 Standard Response Format

**Sukses (single resource):**
```json
{ "data": { "id": "...", "title": "..." } }
```

**Sukses (collection):**
```json
{
  "data": [ ... ],
  "meta": {
    "total": 42,
    "limit": 20,
    "offset": 0
  }
}
```

**Error:**
```json
{
  "error": "track_not_found",
  "message": "Track with this id does not exist",
  "details": { "id": "uuid" }
}
```

`details` opsional, dipakai untuk field-level validation errors.

**Validation error (dari Zod):**
```json
{
  "error": "validation_error",
  "message": "Invalid request body",
  "details": {
    "fields": [
      { "path": "title", "message": "Required" },
      { "path": "duration", "message": "Must be ISO 8601 duration" }
    ]
  }
}
```

## 0.4 Standard HTTP Status Codes

| Status | Kapan |
|---|---|
| 200 OK | GET sukses, PATCH sukses, DELETE sukses |
| 201 Created | POST sukses bikin resource |
| 204 No Content | DELETE sukses tanpa body |
| 400 Bad Request | Body/query invalid (Zod fail) |
| 401 Unauthorized | Tidak ada/token invalid |
| 403 Forbidden | Auth ada tapi tidak berhak |
| 404 Not Found | Resource tidak ada |
| 409 Conflict | Duplikasi (misal follow dua kali) |
| 422 Unprocessable | Business rule gagal |
| 500 Internal Server Error | Unexpected |
| 501 Not Implemented | Stub endpoint |
| 503 Service Unavailable | DB atau dependency down |

